{"title":"2017 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By finding a common denominator, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23ff72be03eaa06690b47e6349cade434c034e6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea7648fb81a5ca94609c0b305f275abaf37d98b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{21} &gt; \\frac{3}{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" />. Similarly, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/1/8e1b92886d6361fc21ec08ba7a5cbd122a2de8cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{6} &lt; \\frac{3}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"52\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/9/879e379cd67dc041bd51e1cdf4a6b2ea3fc26740.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" /> is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd2d2f0dc1da3da73a0e4c89c5807f986c866c92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m + 1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"53\" height=\"38\" /> is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/9/9597f34a1648bc77531b3887de9097a4e5628d1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{8} &gt; \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/b/4dbe3a328d9cdbd4db5f39a74e91ed1ea9f092e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &gt; \\frac{8}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"55\" height=\"38\" />. This occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/f/24f4606bd5646f403a4676964fe7fea017583c28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdc5ddbd157ae9f9675ea205bce9ff3d439926d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m + 1}{8} &lt; \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/2/6525db48e45889919c20df7949cc57732e47d32d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m + 1 &lt; \\frac{2 \\times 8}{3} = \\frac{16}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"164\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d212fe56e78f0e76ee06f4b5fb6469c7c70c4eae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &lt; \\frac{16}{3} - 1 = \\frac{16 - 3 \\times 1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"205\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/d/aade0616a2e919616935bc3fef262c7e0882e034.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &lt; \\frac{13}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>We see that this occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac0fbf233e3b8b856b9b0d140d706ccaccf5a5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{13}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Combining everything, we see that the possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba9571a7a8e2fa5002609cccf8a74b630bd8590.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{m = 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"62\" height=\"25\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/6/e661ae31b533a03ed335ed81f8d576dc11e40651.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{m = 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"62\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018003614\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 116/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 396/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5865/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.225      1 2017_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    7.225      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36949:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018003614 and revision id 285803. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}